msgid "The modem is restarting (network locks or a SIM switch, about half a minute), try again shortly"
msgstr "The modem is restarting (network locks or a SIM switch, about half a minute), try again shortly"

msgid "A long AT command is still running in the background; try again when it has finished"
msgstr "Pitkä AT-komento on vielä käynnissä taustalla; yritä uudelleen, kun se on valmis"

msgid "This command needs confirmation"
